# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for CrateTests (run with TSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=tests/tsan.supp).
#
# RigLooper::copyLayerAudio copies a playing loop without its lock while an overdub may be
# writing into it. The audio thread notes every page it writes during the copy and copies those
# pages again itself (under the lock) before the copy is used, so what this read there is
# always replaced. Only this one function is excused.
race:copyUnsynchronised
